  "summary": "The CX-IR is an infrared combustible gas sensor from Teledyne Detcon with a 4-20 mA output and a Modbus RTU RS-485 port. The holding registers give the range, gas reading in %LEL, span level, sensor life, fault bits and calibration control, plus optional smart-battery registers in the 48199-48206 block. This map covers the documented registers except temperature and voltage.",
