  },
  "notes": [
    "Left out: 40010 sensor temperature (°C, no data type or sign given) and 48205 battery/input voltage (unit volts but no scale given). Reserved registers 40008-40009 and 40012-40013 are skipped.",
    "The gas reading is listed in %LEL. A range divisor register exists (40014) but the manual does not say how it applies, so no scale is set.",
    "Calibration enable/status codes are not listed in the CX-IR manual.",
    "Supported functions: 03, 06 and 16. Writes to read-only registers are acknowledged but ignored.",
    "Battery registers only work with a Detcon smart battery pack; check bit 4 of 48204 first. Battery status refreshes about every 60 s."
  ],
